Besides showing the file existence, the function also returns the path of the file. So, the complete call is:

```
{
    "type": "function",
    "function": {
        "name": "file_exists",
        "parameters": {
            "path": "C:\\Users\\me\\Documents\\minutes.txt"
        }
    },
    "parameters": {
        "path": "C:\\Users\\me\\Documents\\minutes.txt"
    }
}
```

This will return the path of the file and a boolean value indicating whether the file exists or not.
